        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Welcome back to the stables with Pony Friends 2 the sequel to the top selling DS title, now coming to the Nintendo Wii! Pony Friends 2 allows players the chance to create their perfect Pony and take part in fun activities. Featuring 12 Pony breeds (4 new breeds) players can customize every aspect of its appearance, along with its own unique personality. Players can choose all their Pony's accessories and even design some of their own. Taking special care of their Pony to keep it clean and healthy, players can take it on trail rides across different landscapes and environments. Grab the reins, photograph wildlife and unlock a whole host of secrets on your journey. Pony Friends 2 features an exciting and energetic competitive mode: players can compete in races and trick competitions alone or with a friend (single cart play).",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
